.TH CLAW 1 "2026-05-28" "claw 0.2.0" "Claw Compiler"
.SH NAME
claw \- the Claw programming language compiler
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B claw
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIFILE.claw\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Claw is a systems programming language with deterministic memory management,
zero GC pause, and compiler-managed lifetimes.
.SH EXECUTION MODES
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-tokens
Print tokens only.
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-ast
Print AST.
.TP
.BR \-\-compact\-ast
Print compact AST representation (AI-friendly).
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-semantic
Run semantic analysis.
.TP
.BR \-T ", " \-\-typecheck
Run type checking.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-run
Interpret AST directly.
.TP
.BR \-b ", " \-\-bytecode
Compile to bytecode and run in VM.
.TP
.BR \-j ", " \-\-jit
JIT compile and execute.
.TP
.BR \-H ", " \-\-hybrid
Hybrid mode: interpret + JIT hot paths.
.TP
.BR \-C ", " \-\-ccodegen
Generate C code.
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-native
Generate x86-64 native code.
.TP
.BR \-\-aot
AOT compile to executable (x86-64 + Mach-O).
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-wasm
Generate WebAssembly.
.TP
.BR \-i ", " \-\-repl
Start REPL interactive mode.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIFILE\fR
Set output file.
.TP
.BR \-O\fILEVEL\fR
Set optimization level (0-3).
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Enable verbose output.
.TP
.BR \-\-time
Show compilation time.
.TP
.BR \-\-show\-ir
Show generated IR/code.
.TP
.BR \-\-diagnostics\-json
Output diagnostics as JSON.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.claw/cache/builds
AOT build cache directory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR claw-lsp (1),
.BR claw-repl (1)
